{"id": "62712", "title": "梦意阑珊", "author": "水尧儿", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 12, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/62/62712.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／未定\r\n关键字：孟意珊 　陌翩然 　蒋东彬\r\n\r\n女人这样的生物，是万万不可轻视的。\r\n她不爱你，怎样都好。\r\n她若是真的爱上了你，那对于一个男人来说，不是幸运，就是灾难。\r\n\r\n有各种肉啊，有甜宠肉，有虐恋肉，偶尔来节选段虐恋的吧……", "base": "files/article/html/62/62712", "chapters": [{"title": "1-11", "file": "9306314.html", "available": false}, {"title": "12-23", "file": "9306315.html", "available": false}, {"title": "24-34", "file": "9306316.html", "available": false}, {"title": "35-44", "file": "9306318.html", "available": false}, {"title": "45-55", "file": "9306320.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-64", "file": "9306323.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-67+番外", "file": "9306327.html", "available": false}, {"title": "命运之轮回1-10", "file": "9306330.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-17", "file": "9306332.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-28", "file": "9306334.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-33", "file": "9306337.html", "available": false}, {"title": "34完结+番外", "file": "9306339.html", "available": false}]}